      ],
      "size": [
        800,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 16,
      "mode": 0,
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Kromoss Realism Create (experimental)\nReddit dual-turbo realism recipe adapted to the existing Kromoss BF16 checkpoint, Qwen3.5 9B encoder and Flux2 VAE. No INT8 checkpoint.\nDMD2 1.0 + older DMD 0.5 + Smartphone Snapshot Photo Reality v14 0.5. The photo trigger is automatically prepended to the scene.\n12 steps, CFG 1, Euler/simple, shift 5. Set Studio Resolution to 1.5 MP; the normal Studio resolution/aspect controls remain authoritative.\nThe guide's negative prompt has no guidance effect at CFG 1; conditioning starts empty. No Destripe or color/depth adapter.\nExperimental combination: Lodestones recommends one turbo adapter at a time. Image quality on Kromoss is not established.\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/StableDiffusion/comments/1xf5i17/moss_turbo_without_the_blur_for_realism/"
      ]
    },
